00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:13,923
Al Jazeera says the NATO summit in Ankara was dominated by President Trump's sharp criticism of Europe, new defence-spending pledges, Ukraine support, and rising tension with Iran.

2
00:00:13,873 --> 00:00:20,417
Alliance members promised larger budgets, but political unity remains difficult.

3
00:00:20,417 --> 00:00:30,770
The summit shows that NATO is trying to strengthen its military position while managing disputes inside the alliance and crises outside it.

